 "title": "40 V P-channel trench MOSFET in SOIC-8",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 1.1, March 2024",
  "pages": 4
 },
 "summary": "A single P-channel enhancement MOSFET on a trench process, rated -40 V drain to source and -10 A continuous at 25 °C ambient (steady state), in an eight-lead SOIC with three source leads, one gate lead and four drain leads. On-resistance is at most 15 mΩ with the gate at -10 V and 20 mΩ at -4.5 V, with 42 nC typical total gate charge. Every part is avalanche (UIS) tested and gate-resistance tested. It is intended for DC-DC converters.",
 "key_figures": [
  [
   "Drain-source voltage",
   "-40 V"
